---
const stages = [
  {
    id: 'infer', number: '01', agent: 'Theory-of-Mind agent', verb: 'Infer',
    question: 'What might the speaker actually mean?',
    copy: 'Preserve ambiguity as typed hypotheses instead of committing to the literal reading.',
    output: 'Hₜ = { reluctance, permission, repair }'
  },
  {
    id: 'constrain', number: '02', agent: 'Moral agent', verb: 'Constrain',
    question: 'Which interpretation survives the situation?',
    copy: 'Use role, history, cultural expectations, and ethical constraints to revise and select.',
    output: 'h̃* = polite reluctance'
  },
  {
    id: 'validate', number: '03', agent: 'Response agent', verb: 'Validate',
    question: 'Does the action remain faithful to that state?',
    copy: 'Generate from the selected hypothesis, audit empathy and coherence, then release or retry.',
    output: 'oₜ = acknowledge + preserve agency'
  }
] as const;
---

<figure class="essay-figure native-figure full-bleed architecture-visual" data-metamind-demo>
  <div class="architecture-shell">
    <header class="visual-head">
      <div>
        <span>MetaMind / interactive system trace</span>
        <strong>Follow one ambiguous utterance through the control loop.</strong>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="demo-play" data-demo-play aria-pressed="true"><i></i><span>Pause trace</span></button>
    </header>

    <section class="example-context" aria-label="Example input">
      <div>
        <span>Observed utterance · u<sub>t</sub></span>
        <blockquote>“Sure, go ahead. I don’t mind.”</blockquote>
      </div>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Context · C<sub>t</sub></dt><dd>A colleague has proposed changing a shared plan after the speaker hesitated.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Memory · M<sub>t</sub></dt><dd>The speaker previously preferred the original plan and tends to avoid direct disagreement.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <div class="stage-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="MetaMind processing stages">
      {stages.map((stage, index) => (
        <button
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          id={`demo-tab-${stage.id}`}
          aria-controls={`demo-panel-${stage.id}`}
          aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
          tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1}
          data-demo-tab={index}
        >
          <b>{stage.number}</b><span>{stage.verb}</span><small>{stage.agent}</small>
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="stage-panels" aria-live="polite">
      <article class="stage-panel infer-panel" id="demo-panel-infer" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="demo-tab-infer" data-demo-panel="0">
        <div class="stage-copy">
          <span>{stages[0].agent}</span><h3>{stages[0].question}</h3><p>{stages[0].copy}</p>
          <strong>{stages[0].output}</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="hypothesis-space" aria-label="Candidate mental-state hypotheses">
          <div class="hypothesis selected"><span>H₁ · intention</span><strong>Polite reluctance</strong><p>Literal consent conflicts with hesitation and prior preference.</p><i style="--p:78%">0.78</i></div>
          <div class="hypothesis"><span>H₂ · belief</span><strong>Genuine permission</strong><p>The sentence may be intended literally.</p><i style="--p:47%">0.47</i></div>
          <div class="hypothesis"><span>H₃ · social goal</span><strong>Relational repair</strong><p>Agreement may be an attempt to reduce tension.</p><i style="--p:61%">0.61</i></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stage-panel constrain-panel" id="demo-panel-constrain" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="demo-tab-constrain" data-demo-panel="1" hidden>
        <div class="stage-copy">
          <span>{stages[1].agent}</span><h3>{stages[1].question}</h3><p>{stages[1].copy}</p>
          <strong>{stages[1].output}</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="constraint-field" aria-label="Norm-aware revision of candidate hypotheses">
          <div class="constraint-input"><span>Candidate set</span><strong>H₁ · H₂ · H₃</strong></div>
          <div class="constraint-gates">
            <span><i></i>Role history</span><span><i></i>Prior preference</span><span><i></i>Power asymmetry</span><span><i></i>Preserve agency</span>
          </div>
          <div class="constraint-output"><span>Selected state</span><strong>Polite reluctance</strong><p>Revised from “consent” to “consent with unresolved preference.”</p></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="stage-panel validate-panel" id="demo-panel-validate" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="demo-tab-validate" data-demo-panel="2" hidden>
        <div class="stage-copy">
          <span>{stages[2].agent}</span><h3>{stages[2].question}</h3><p>{stages[2].copy}</p>
          <strong>{stages[2].output}</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="response-audit" aria-label="Response synthesis and reflective validation">
          <blockquote>“I can keep the original plan, or we can compare both options. Which would you actually prefer?”</blockquote>
          <div class="audit-metric"><span>Empathy</span><i style="--score:88%"></i><b>0.88</b></div>
          <div class="audit-metric"><span>Coherence</span><i style="--score:93%"></i><b>0.93</b></div>
          <div class="release-state"><span>U(o<sub>t</sub>) ≥ τ</span><strong>Release response</strong><i>✓</i></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-loop">
      <span>Persistent social memory</span>
      <p><b>Retrieve</b> relevant role and preference state</p><i>→</i>
      <p><b>Write</b> only validated hypotheses or explicit feedback</p><i>→</i>
      <p><b>Carry</b> revised state into turn <em>t + 1</em></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption><strong>Figure 1. A concrete MetaMind trace.</strong> The architecture delays commitment: it keeps competing interpretations visible until context and social constraints can change their rank, then checks whether the response preserves the selected state. Memory is updated only after validation, preventing an early misreading from silently becoming persistent user state.</figcaption>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-metamind-demo]').forEach((root) => {
    const tabs = [...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-demo-tab]')];
    const panels = [...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-demo-panel]')];
    const play = root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-demo-play]');
    const playLabel = play?.querySelector('span');
    const reducedMotion = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    let current = 0;
    let timer: number | undefined;

    const select = (index: number, userInitiated = false) => {
      current = index;
      tabs.forEach((tab, tabIndex) => {
        const active = tabIndex === index;
        tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));
        tab.tabIndex = active ? 0 : -1;
      });
      panels.forEach((panel, panelIndex) => { panel.hidden = panelIndex !== index; });
      root.style.setProperty('--demo-progress', `${((index + 1) / tabs.length) * 100}%`);
      if (userInitiated) stop();
    };
    const stop = () => {
      if (timer) window.clearInterval(timer);
      timer = undefined;
      play?.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
      if (playLabel) playLabel.textContent = 'Play trace';
    };
    const start = () => {
      if (reducedMotion) return;
      if (timer) window.clearInterval(timer);
      timer = window.setInterval(() => select((current + 1) % tabs.length), 4200);
      play?.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');
      if (playLabel) playLabel.textContent = 'Pause trace';
    };

    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => select(index, true));
      tab.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        if (!['ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'Home', 'End'].includes(event.key)) return;
        event.preventDefault();
        const next = event.key === 'Home' ? 0 : event.key === 'End' ? tabs.length - 1 : event.key === 'ArrowLeft' ? (index - 1 + tabs.length) % tabs.length : (index + 1) % tabs.length;
        tabs[next].focus();
        select(next, true);
      });
    });
    play?.addEventListener('click', () => timer ? stop() : start());
    select(0);
    if (reducedMotion) stop(); else start();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .architecture-visual { --demo-progress: 33.333%; padding: 0 !important; background: transparent !important; border: 0 !important; }
  .architecture-shell { padding: clamp(22px,3.2vw,42px); color: #edf7f5; background: #071c24; border: 1px solid #173e48; box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(7,20,30,.16); font-family: var(--sans); }
  .visual-head { padding-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17); }
  .visual-head > div { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .visual-head span, .example-context span, .stage-copy > span, .constraint-field span, .release-state span, .memory-loop > span { color: #719198; font-size: .56rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .visual-head strong { max-width: 720px; font: 410 clamp(1.55rem,3vw,2.8rem)/1.05 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .demo-play { padding: 9px 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #d9e8e7; background: #0d3038; border: 1px solid #28515a; cursor: pointer; font: 750 .55rem/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .demo-play i { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #50d7c8; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(80,215,200,.12); }
  .demo-play[aria-pressed="false"] i { border-radius: 0; clip-path: polygon(0 0,100% 50%,0 100%); }
  .example-context { margin-top: 24px; padding: 22px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: 24px; background: #0b2932; border: 1px solid #1b4650; }
  .example-context blockquote { margin: 14px 0 0; color: #f4f1e9; font: 430 clamp(1.55rem,2.8vw,2.55rem)/1.06 var(--serif); }
  .example-context dl { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .example-context dl div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .example-context dt { color: #50d7c8; font-size: .55rem; font-weight: 780; }
  .example-context dd { margin: 0; color: #94aeb3; font-size: .59rem; line-height: 1.52; }
  .stage-tabs { position: relative; margin-top: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); border: 1px solid #1b4650; }
  .stage-tabs::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: -1px; width: var(--demo-progress); height: 3px; background: #50d7c8; transition: width .35s ease; }
  .stage-tabs button { min-height: 88px; padding: 15px 18px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; gap: 3px 10px; text-align: left; color: #718f95; background: #09232c; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid #1b4650; cursor: pointer; }
  .stage-tabs button:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .stage-tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { color: #edf7f5; background: #0f333c; }
  .stage-tabs b { grid-row: 1 / 3; color: #50d7c8; font: 460 1.15rem/1 var(--serif); }
  .stage-tabs span { font: 650 .82rem/1.1 var(--serif); }
  .stage-tabs small { color: #6f8b91; font-size: .49rem; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .stage-panels { margin-top: 14px; }
  .stage-panel { min-height: 360px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .72fr 1.28fr; background: #0a252e; border: 1px solid #1b4650; }
  .stage-panel[hidden] { display: none; }
  .stage-copy { padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-right: 1px solid #1b4650; }
  .stage-copy h3 { margin: 36px 0 12px; color: #f4f1e9; font: 420 clamp(1.55rem,2.5vw,2.3rem)/1.05 var(--serif); }
  .stage-copy p { margin: 0; color: #89a2a7; font-size: .62rem; line-height: 1.62; }
  .stage-copy > strong { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 20px; color: #50d7c8; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); font: 470 1rem/1.25 var(--serif); }
  .hypothesis-space { padding: 22px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .hypothesis { padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: #93a9ad; background: #0d3039; border: 1px solid #244a53; }
  .hypothesis.selected { background: #113d45; border-color: #50d7c8; }
  .hypothesis > span { color: #6f8e94; font-size: .49rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hypothesis strong { margin: 32px 0 10px; color: #eef6f5; font: 470 1.1rem/1.05 var(--serif); }
  .hypothesis p { margin: 0; font-size: .54rem; line-height: 1.52; }
  .hypothesis i { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 22px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: var(--p) 1fr; gap: 8px; color: #50d7c8; font: 700 .56rem/1 var(--sans); font-style: normal; }
  .hypothesis i::before { content: ''; height: 4px; background: #50d7c8; }
  .constraint-field { padding: 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .7fr 1fr .95fr; gap: 10px; align-items: stretch; }
  .constraint-input, .constraint-output { padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: #0e3139; border: 1px solid #254c55; }
  .constraint-input strong, .constraint-output strong { margin-top: 28px; color: #edf7f5; font: 450 1.4rem/1.05 var(--serif); }
  .constraint-output { border-color: #50d7c8; }
  .constraint-output strong { color: #50d7c8; }
  .constraint-output p { margin: 14px 0 0; color: #89a2a7; font-size: .55rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .constraint-gates { display: grid; gap: 7px; }
  .constraint-gates span { padding: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #b6c9cb; background: #163a43; border: 1px solid #28515a; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .constraint-gates i { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #50d7c8; border-radius: 50%; }
  .response-audit { padding: 24px; display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 15px; }
  .response-audit blockquote { margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 22px; color: #071c24; background: #50d7c8; font: 450 clamp(1.2rem,2.1vw,1.8rem)/1.18 var(--serif); }
  .audit-metric { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr 38px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; color: #9db1b5; font-size: .56rem; }
  .audit-metric i { height: 5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#50d7c8 var(--score),#244650 var(--score)); }
  .audit-metric b { color: #d8e8e7; font: 470 .76rem/1 var(--serif); }
  .release-state { margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 18px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 24px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); }
  .release-state strong { color: #edf7f5; font: 460 1.1rem/1 var(--serif); }
  .release-state i { width: 22px; height: 22px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #071c24; background: #50d7c8; border-radius: 50%; font-style: normal; font-size: .65rem; }
  .memory-loop { margin-top: 14px; padding: 18px 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr auto 1.55fr auto 1.1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: center; color: #a7bec1; background: #081f27; border: 1px solid #1b4650; }
  .memory-loop > span { color: #50d7c8; }
  .memory-loop p { margin: 0; font-size: .54rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .memory-loop b { color: #e3eded; font-weight: 760; }
  .memory-loop > i { color: #50d7c8; font-style: normal; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .visual-head, .example-context, .stage-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
    .visual-head { flex-direction: column; }
    .stage-copy { min-height: 290px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1b4650; }
    .hypothesis-space, .constraint-field { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hypothesis { min-height: 220px; }
    .stage-tabs button { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stage-tabs b { grid-row: auto; }
    .stage-tabs small { display: none; }
    .memory-loop { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .memory-loop > i { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .architecture-shell { padding: 18px 14px; }
    .example-context { padding: 18px 16px; }
    .example-context dl div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3px; }
    .stage-tabs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stage-tabs::after { top: 0; right: auto; bottom: 0; width: 3px; height: var(--demo-progress); }
    .stage-tabs button { min-height: 70px; grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1b4650; }
    .stage-tabs button:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .stage-tabs b { grid-row: 1 / 3; }
    .stage-tabs small { display: block; }
    .stage-copy { min-height: 250px; padding: 22px 18px; }
    .hypothesis-space, .constraint-field, .response-audit { padding: 16px; }
    .hypothesis { min-height: 190px; padding: 16px; }
    .audit-metric { grid-template-columns: 70px minmax(0,1fr) 34px; gap: 8px; }
    .release-state { grid-template-columns: 1fr 22px; }
    .release-state strong { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .memory-loop { padding: 16px; }
  }
</style>
